{"title":"2011 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/b/1fb270c711d58ade068d7153df02569263177e56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 + 2) + (8 + 6) + (4 + 7) + (3 + 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"287\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/8604338c2dbf293c2887e3b7da4e6615dfb8857f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 35 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 37 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 40 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 45 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/2/0c20e3a614a74e098b28a1513df7a756dce4bb51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 + 2) + (8 + 6) + (4 + 7) + (3 + 2) = 7 + 14 + 11 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"432\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4c1a09641744508040413a926fbb2b472b950be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=21 + 16 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 37}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"168\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<